<node id="11125182" title="Re^2: List into two-dimensional array" created="2020-12-14 14:13:01" updated="2020-12-14 14:13:01" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
sub group {
   my $n = shift;
   my @rv;
   push @rv, splice(@_, 0, $n) while @_;
   return @rv;
}
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That just returns a copy of the original list. You probably meant &lt;c&gt;push @rv, [ splice(@_, 0, $n) ] while @_;&lt;/c&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
